import '../styles/conversations.css';
---
<section id="conversations"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2><span class="en">BHW Conversations</span><span class="hu">BHW beszélgetések</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/conversations/"><span class="en">Explore the series →</span><span class="hu">A sorozat →</span></a></div>
  <p class="conversation-intro"><span class="en">Meet the people behind the hardware. Ideas, detours and what it takes to make them work.</span><span class="hu">Ismerd meg a hardver mögött álló embereket: ötletek, kitérők és a megvalósítás kihívásai.</span></p>
  <article class="conversation-feature">
    <div class="conversation-cover">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9Nfxdmmfo1k" title="Yannic Metz full interview · Budapest Hardware Club" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="en">Episode 02 · Yannic Metz · Creative Dock</span><span class="hu">02. epizód · Yannic Metz · Creative Dock</span></p>
      <h3><a href="/conversations/yannic-metz/"><span class="en">Two founders don't need culture</span><span class="hu">Két alapítónak nem kell kultúra</span></a></h3>
      <p><span class="en">He used to build everything himself, then helped teams build. Now AI has him prototyping again. Yannic on when culture starts to matter, and what he offers early hardware teams.</span><span class="hu">Régen mindent maga épített, aztán csapatoknak segített építeni. Most a mesterséges intelligencia miatt újra prototípusokat készít. Yannic arról, mikor kezd számítani a kultúra, és mit kínál a korai hardveres csapatoknak.</span></p>
      <div class="conversation-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/conversations/yannic-metz/"><span class="en">Read the article →</span><span class="hu">A cikk elolvasása →</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://youtu.be/9Nfxdmmfo1k"><span class="en">Watch on YouTube ↗</span><span class="hu">Megtekintés a YouTube-on ↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <ul class="conversation-list">
    <li><a href="/conversations/steven-antalics/"><img src="/images/conversations/steven-and-andrii-prague-bright.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" alt="" loading="lazy" /><span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="en">Episode 01 · Steven Antalics · EkoHaul</span><span class="hu">01. epizód · Steven Antalics · EkoHaul</span></span><strong><span class="en">A sunny roof and a twenty-year-old idea</span><span class="hu">Egy napsütötte tető és egy húszéves ötlet</span></strong></span></a></li>
  </ul>
</div></section>
